-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party / vendored components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This extension vendors in-page accessibility-snapshot code derived from the
Playwright project (https://github.com/microsoft/playwright) under
lib/playwright-aria/. Those files are a clean, condensed TypeScript
reimplementation ported from Playwright's
packages/injected/src/roleUtils.ts and packages/injected/src/ariaSnapshot.ts,
and remain licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Vendored files and their derived scope:
  - lib/playwright-aria/roles.ts        — implicit ARIA role table (HTML-AAM)
                                          and presentation/none conflict logic.
  - lib/playwright-aria/accessibleName.ts — accessible-name (accname) precedence
                                          chain.
  - lib/playwright-aria/states.ts       — ARIA state extraction
                                          (checked/disabled/expanded/pressed/
                                          selected/level/invalid).
  - lib/playwright-aria/index.ts        — barrel re-export.

Each vendored file:
  - carries an Apache-2.0 header crediting Microsoft Playwright,
  - states prominently that it has been MODIFIED from the original (per
    Apache-2.0 section 4(b): trimmed to the common element set, restructured for
    content-script use with no Playwright runtime, and adapted to the
    muk_ai_browser SnapshotNode shape), and
  - is attributed here in this NOTICE file.

The orchestration in lib/perception.ts (DOM walk, visibility/viewport filter,
stable-ref scheme, serialization, diff marking) is original MuK IT work and is
not derived from Playwright.

